{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108504","id":2657632558,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6eaEEu","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108504","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108504.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108504.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108504","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108504/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108504/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108504/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/047edb8933eaaf7b1aeedbe49990f61a5ef2cae1","number":108504,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Avoid unnecessary copy in `ClassDB::get_property_list`","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I was poking around the Alloc > Duplicate benchmark and noticed that there's an unnecessary copy happening in `ClassDB::get_property_list`. `validate_property` must be run on a copy of the `PropertyInfo`, but a copy has to be made during `push_back` anyways, so we can rearrange things a bit and only perform one copy instead of two.\r\n\r\nI ran the Alloc > Duplicate benchmark nine times for each and dropped the top two and bottom two of each:\r\n```\r\noptimize-duplicate\r\n------------------------------\r\nRunning benchmark: C++/Alloc/duplicate\r\nResult: {\"time\":4387.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4422.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4426.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4432.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4443.0}\r\n\r\nmaster\r\n------------------------------\r\nRunning benchmark: C++/Alloc/duplicate\r\nResult: {\"time\":4704.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4710.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4730.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4736.0}\r\nResult: {\"time\":4764.0}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt's only a ~6.5% speedup, but it's a pretty core function so it seemed worth a PR.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"